{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Crawler is a horror game where you explore vents but not everything goes to plan, as you explore the vents of Blackwell Station you realize its too late to leave and you must find a new exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE REASON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/46d49068d0d14f3c37f6ead3b195f331.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the reason you are here in the first place is because you were called by Lumenex Dynamics the company behind Blackwell Station to go into Blackwell Station through the HVAC system because the facility has been dark for the last 48 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/e0432cec94f41cee4a1718f7c09df59c.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist and turn through the mysterious old and massive ventilation system of Blackwell station while something or someone hunts you down. You will find multiple weird areas almost like other people were living there before you... you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/73d460d9b08302651f63e5586603d5a0.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and solve dangerous puzzles disable giant fans, reveal what lies behind a vent door, and power the facility back up. And complete these to escape whatever is hunting you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/8f8899be1c6af14202d8e6a0176442d8.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through Blackwell Station will uncover the secrets and piece together the lore and hidden details of what happened before you... only the most explorative and observant players will uncover it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE ENDINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/b45845a501085df0434f75abc05c8a37.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 endings you can achieve by finding secret items or doing things you probably shouldn't do... explore optional areas, find hidden items, and more to unlock the 3 endings and find all the hidden details to get all the lore.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941650?t=1757676286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/145c7d0b2317fd9170916809b963a1c9e8c1e3dd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757676286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/a8bfca8a8191d9e0a079bb5a5ab409d4cdecfe6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757676286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/a8bfca8a8191d9e0a079bb5a5ab409d4cdecfe6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757676286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Crawler is a horror game where you explore vents but not everything goes to plan, as you explore the vents of Blackwell Station you realize its too late to leave and you must find a new exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE REASON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/46d49068d0d14f3c37f6ead3b195f331.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the reason you are here in the first place is because you were called by Lumenex Dynamics the company behind Blackwell Station to go into Blackwell Station through the HVAC system because the facility has been dark for the last 48 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/e0432cec94f41cee4a1718f7c09df59c.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist and turn through the mysterious old and massive ventilation system of Blackwell station while something or someone hunts you down. You will find multiple weird areas almost like other people were living there before you... you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/73d460d9b08302651f63e5586603d5a0.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and solve dangerous puzzles disable giant fans, reveal what lies behind a vent door, and power the facility back up. And complete these to escape whatever is hunting you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/8f8899be1c6af14202d8e6a0176442d8.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through Blackwell Station will uncover the secrets and piece together the lore and hidden details of what happened before you... only the most explorative and observant players will uncover it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE ENDINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/b45845a501085df0434f75abc05c8a37.avif?t=1757676286\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 endings you can achieve by finding secret items or doing things you probably shouldn't do... explore optional areas, find hidden items, and more to unlock the 3 endings and find all the hidden details to get all the lore.</p>","developers":["CratesDiamond"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/ceb9521b65b14f9c6f43c0bac53d87a6d1b79962/header.jpg?t=1757676286","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 CratesDiamond. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nThe Last Crawler and all associated content, characters, and assets are all property of<br />\r\nCratesDiamond.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnreal Engine is a trademark of Epic Games, Inc. and is used under license.<br />\r\nAn