4553574a2/ss_c815cfed9a02acf07cebd65dfb77b254553574a2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757676286","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/c815cfed9a02acf07cebd65dfb77b254553574a2/ss_c815cfed9a02acf07cebd65dfb77b254553574a2.600x338.jpg?t=1757676286"}],"short_description":"In The Last Crawler you play as a ventilation repair man named David and you enter the vents of Blackwell Station but everything is not as it seems. The vents are not safe and you must find a new way out before its too late.","steam_appid":3941650,"support_info":{"email":"Cratesdiamondofficial@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}